#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Agriculture Farm is a simple, clean, yet responsive website for agricultural websites. All agricultural Agriculture Farmes will find the thee really convenient to create a website and work with it. The theme can be used for Agribusiness, Organic Farming, Crop Management, Farm Equipment, Agritourism, AgriTech, Sustainable Farming, Dairy Farm, Livestock Management, Farm-to-Table, Farm Cooperative, Rural Development, Agri Supply, Farm Market, Agri Consultancy. With so much to offer for your website, this theme is highly responsive making the website automatically readjust its size according to the various screen sizes. With a professional design at your disposal, you can obtain a lot out of it. The layout is immensely flexible and gives you a robust WordPress theme that is designed using a powerful Bootstrap framework. To boost your search engine visibility in order to make your organic traffic grow, you will find SEO-friendly codes. This theme is apt for many types of businesses such as farming, hoticulture, gardening, landscaping, plant care, eco nature, etc. The design is mobile-friendly and users will be able to access the website through mobile devices. The adaptable design ensures that your website gives an outstanding experience to the users. It is a robust WordPress theme made with secure and clean codes that are also optimized. These codes will result in a faster page load time making your website work without any lag. This free theme includes many Call To Action Button (CTA) that are going to work miraculously for improving your conversion rates. Social media icons that are inbuilt in the website will give you the online webspace it deserves. Demo: https://www.themeshopy.com/agriculture-farm-pro/"
msgstr ""

